IELTS.lesson({"test": 6, "part": 2, "title": "Test 6, Part 2 — the long turn", "candidate": "samir", "script": [{"who": "examiner", "text": "Now, I'm going to give you a topic and I'd like you to talk about it for one to two minutes.", "ar": "الآن، سأعطيك موضوعاً وأريدك أن تتحدّث عنه مدة دقيقة إلى دقيقتين.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/93e218b519712f7a.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Before you talk you'll have one minute to think about what you're going to say. You can make some notes if you wish. Do you understand?", "ar": "قبل أن تتحدّث سيكون لديك دقيقة واحدة للتفكير في ما ستقوله. ويمكنك تدوين بعض الملاحظات إن أردت. هل هذا واضح؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/5a7c17f0603cb77a.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Yes, I understand.", "ar": "نعم، واضح.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/ba9408565bf3db8b.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Here is some paper and a pencil for making notes, and here is your topic.", "ar": "هذه ورقة وقلم لتدوين الملاحظات، وهذا موضوعك.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/dcc80d495df59156.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "I'd like you to describe a person who influenced you.", "ar": "أودّ منك أن تصف شخصاً أثّر فيك.", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/f052a3b9d243aa51.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a person who influenced you.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>who the person is</li><li>how you know them</li><li>what kind of person they are</li><li>and explain how they influenced you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "You have one minute. I'll tell you when the minute is up.", "ar": "لديك دقيقة واحدة. سأخبرك عندما تنتهي الدقيقة.", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/2b1e1b3092896694.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a person who influenced you.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>who the person is</li><li>how you know them</li><li>what kind of person they are</li><li>and explain how they influenced you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "All right? Remember you have one to two minutes for this. Don't worry if I stop you. I'll tell you when the time is up. Can you start speaking now, please?", "ar": "حسناً؟ تذكّر أن لديك دقيقة إلى دقيقتين. لا تقلق إن أوقفتك. سأخبرك عندما ينتهي الوقت. هل يمكنك أن تبدأ الحديث الآن من فضلك؟", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/12de1969ab105c17.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a person who influenced you.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>who the person is</li><li>how you know them</li><li>what kind of person they are</li><li>and explain how they influenced you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I want to talk about a man called Ustaz Fouad, who taught me Arabic at my school in Damascus when I was sixteen and who I then worked alongside for eleven years, which is a strange thing to happen to anybody.", "ar": "أريد أن أتحدّث عن رجل اسمه الأستاذ فؤاد، علّمني العربيّة في مدرستي في دمشق حين كنت في السادسة عشرة، ثمّ عملت إلى جانبه إحدى عشرة سنة، وهذا أمر غريب أن يحدث لأيّ أحد.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/20723689fd403fd9.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a person who influenced you.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>who the person is</li><li>how you know them</li><li>what kind of person they are</li><li>and explain how they influenced you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "He was not, I should say, a warm man.", "ar": "ولم يكن، ينبغي أن أقول، رجلاً دافئاً.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/b486b6b642caf916.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a person who influenced you.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>who the person is</li><li>how you know them</li><li>what kind of person they are</li><li>and explain how they influenced you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "He never raised his voice in thirty years and he never told anyone they'd done well either, and both of those facts were known to every student in the building.", "ar": "لم يرفع صوته يوماً في ثلاثين سنة ولم يقل لأحد يوماً إنّه أحسن، وكلتا هاتين الحقيقتين كان يعرفهما كلّ طالب في المبنى.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/41789ecd25ebf5f3.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a person who influenced you.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>who the person is</li><li>how you know them</li><li>what kind of person they are</li><li>and explain how they influenced you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "You did not go to Ustaz Fouad for encouragement.", "ar": "لم يكن أحد يذهب إلى الأستاذ فؤاد طلباً للتشجيع.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/dac2136821526df7.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a person who influenced you.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>who the person is</li><li>how you know them</li><li>what kind of person they are</li><li>and explain how they influenced you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "What he did was wait. You'd answer a question badly and he would simply not say anything. Not in a cold way.", "ar": "ما كان يفعله هو أن ينتظر. تجيب عن سؤال إجابة سيّئة فلا يقول شيئاً ببساطة. وليس بطريقة باردة.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/4fe729b9245537d2.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a person who influenced you.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>who the person is</li><li>how you know them</li><li>what kind of person they are</li><li>and explain how they influenced you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "He'd just leave the silence there, and after about four seconds you'd start talking again, and the second thing you said was always better than the first.", "ar": "كان يترك الصمت هناك فحسب، وبعد أربع ثوانٍ تقريباً تبدأ بالكلام من جديد، ويكون الشيء الثاني الذي تقوله أفضل من الأوّل دائماً.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/aef108b907db9e07.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a person who influenced you.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>who the person is</li><li>how you know them</li><li>what kind of person they are</li><li>and explain how they influenced you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Every single time. I watched him do it to four hundred children and I have never seen it fail.", "ar": "في كلّ مرّة بلا استثناء. رأيته يفعلها مع أربعمئة طفل ولم أرها تفشل قطّ.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/a19ae469afeffd02.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a person who influenced you.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>who the person is</li><li>how you know them</li><li>what kind of person they are</li><li>and explain how they influenced you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "The influence is that I've spent my entire career trying to do that and finding it almost impossible. It looks like doing nothing.", "ar": "والأثر أنّني قضيت حياتي المهنيّة كلّها أحاول أن أفعل ذلك وأجده شبه مستحيل. يبدو وكأنّه لا فعل فيه.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/0fd18d6436c2869a.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a person who influenced you.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>who the person is</li><li>how you know them</li><li>what kind of person they are</li><li>and explain how they influenced you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "It is in fact the hardest thing in a classroom, because everything you feel as a teacher, and everything you feel as a kind person, tells you to rescue a child who is struggling in front of thirty others.", "ar": "وهو في الحقيقة أصعب شيء في الصفّ، لأنّ كلّ ما تشعر به كمعلّم، وكلّ ما تشعر به كإنسان طيّب، يقول لك أنقذ طفلاً يتعثّر أمام ثلاثين غيره.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/c80245f01296743b.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a person who influenced you.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>who the person is</li><li>how you know them</li><li>what kind of person they are</li><li>and explain how they influenced you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "He understood something I'm still only half able to act on, which is that rescuing them is for you and not for them.", "ar": "كان يفهم شيئاً ما زلت أقدر على العمل به نصف قدرة، وهو أنّ إنقاذهم من أجلك أنت لا من أجلهم.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/88522197c84c68eb.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a person who influenced you.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>who the person is</li><li>how you know them</li><li>what kind of person they are</li><li>and explain how they influenced you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "He died in 2019. I teach about a third as well as he did, and I'd say that's the single most useful thing I know about myself.", "ar": "توفّي عام ألفين وتسعة عشر. أنا أعلّم بثلث براعته تقريباً، وأقول إنّ هذه أنفع معلومة أعرفها عن نفسي.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/3903262850462cd9.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a person who influenced you.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>who the person is</li><li>how you know them</li><li>what kind of person they are</li><li>and explain how they influenced you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Thank you. Do you think he knew he had that effect on you?", "ar": "شكراً لك. هل تظنّ أنّه كان يعرف أنّ له هذا الأثر فيك؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/e2bde6fc51f75f51.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I never told him, which I regret in a mild, ordinary way. Mind you, knowing him, he'd have found a way not to respond to it. Probably he'd have waited, of course, until I'd said something better, and everyone who taught in Damascus with him would tell you the same.", "ar": "لم أخبره قطّ، وأندم على ذلك ندماً خفيفاً عاديّاً. على فكرة، بما أنّني أعرفه، كان سيجد طريقة ألّا يردّ على ذلك. على الأرجح كان سينتظر، بالطبع، حتى أقول شيئاً أفضل، وكلّ من علّم معه في دمشق سيقول لك الشيء نفسه.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/b4abe3d298735224.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Thank you. That is the end of Part Two.", "ar": "شكراً لك. بهذا ينتهي القسم الثاني.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/264fec5248fac38c.mp3"}], "boxes": [{"q": "Describe a person who influenced you.", "bullets": ["who the person is", "how you know them", "what kind of person they are", "and explain how they influenced you"], "long": true, "model": "I want to talk about a man called Ustaz Fouad, who taught me Arabic at my school in Damascus when I was sixteen and who I then worked alongside for eleven years, which is a strange thing to happen to anybody. He was not, I should say, a warm man. He never raised his voice in thirty years and he never told anyone they'd done well either, and both of those facts were known to every student in the building. You did not go to Ustaz Fouad for encouragement. What he did was wait. You'd answer a question badly and he would simply not say anything. Not in a cold way. He'd just leave the silence there, and after about four seconds you'd start talking again, and the second thing you said was always better than the first. Every single time. I watched him do it to four hundred children and I have never seen it fail. The influence is that I've spent my entire career trying to do that and finding it almost impossible. It looks like doing nothing. It is in fact the hardest thing in a classroom, because everything you feel as a teacher, and everything you feel as a kind person, tells you to rescue a child who is struggling in front of thirty others. He understood something I'm still only half able to act on, which is that rescuing them is for you and not for them. He died in 2019. I teach about a third as well as he did, and I'd say that's the single most useful thing I know about myself.", "why": "Ustaz Fouad — my own teacher, 1992 then colleague 20 yrs later never raised voice / never praised either the waiting"}, {"q": "Do you think he knew he had that effect on you?", "model": "I never told him, which I regret in a mild, ordinary way. Mind you, knowing him, he'd have found a way not to respond to it. Probably he'd have waited, of course, until I'd said something better, and everyone who taught in Damascus with him would tell you the same.", "why": ""}], "voices": {"examiner": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "candidate": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119"}});
